    "body": "related #40795\r\ndepends on: #40846\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nmore features to add from the original zip plugin that for sure ought to be ported; batch them in small amounts.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nadd the following:\r\n\r\n1. extract entry with `x`\r\n2. bug fixes:\r\n    - support empty zips\r\n    - safety around entries with leading `-` - do not treat them as args to the unzip command.\r\n    - more rigorous testing for zip entry paths\r\n3. general test cleanups",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-31T19:45:15Z",
